Mon Sep 28 05:55:18 UTC 2026 - Priyanka Saggu <priyanka.saggu@suse.com>

- Update to version 1.37.1:
  * Bump images and versions to go 1.26.8 and distroless iptables
  * Refuse UNC symlink targets in Windows subPath resolution
  * Restore only .spec part from ControllerRevision for any StatefulSet
  * fix: make nil DeviceTaintSelector match no devices
  * DRA: avoid integer overflow in per-claim device-limit checks
  * e2e auth: use unprivileged container port in projected podcertificate test
  * fix job pod could not be removed while removing finalizer failed
  * Guard against load balancers without port mappings
  * Avoid leaking node-specific kubelet config into the ConfigMap

- Update .spec file to bump go version build requirements:
  * `BuildRequires:  go >= 1.26.8`
  * ref: https://github.com/kubernetes/kubernetes/blob/v1.37.1/.go-version

